(0,81,40)¢Ÿ(20,81,204)†GAME MODES

††QUEST 

†††‚The QUESTŒ mode allows you to play all 100 levels HEROES
†††offers you. 
†††‚Your aim is to collect a given number (10) of Trail+1
†††‚bonuses and then to get the End-of-Level bonus that
†††will send you to next level.
†††‰(0,0,22)‹(176,20,22)ˆ…End-of-Level
†††‰(0,10,22)‹(176,30,22)†Trail+1
†††‚Trail+1 has the effect of growing your trail.  There
†††‚are two way to get it smaller: take a Trail-1 or lose
†††‚a life.  The End-of-Level bonus first appears when
†††someone's trail reach 10 units.

††DEATH MATCH

†††‚The DEATH MATCHŒ mode allows you to face the other
†††‚players in a fight to death. The aim of the game is to be
†††‚the last player still alive. For this, feel free to use
†††any stratagems you want. Nothing is forbidden.
‡¥(9,130,57)
‡¥(9,140,57)š††KILL THEM ALL
‡¥(9,150,57)
†††‚The KILL THEM ALLŒ mode has only one rule : You have to
†††overwhelm all the people of your competitors.
†††‚It was said "There can be only one", make sure it is
†††yours !
‡‡‡‡‡‡(70,131,100)
‡‡‡‡‡‡(70,141,100)š†††They are among us, find them !
‡‡‡‡‡‡(70,151,80)
‡‡‡‡‡‡(70,161,80)š††COLOR

†††‚The COLORŒ mode is very simple. You have a certain
†††‚amount of time to get a maximum of gems of your color.
†††‚Beware, if you go over your competitor's gems, it's
†††‚your competitor's gem account that you will increase.
†††‚Be also sure not to get crossed gems because you'll
†††‚lose collected gems. Grey ones gives gems to all players
†††‚except the one that goes over it. The Clocks give you
†††extra time.

††TIME CA$H

†††‚The aim of TIME CA$HŒ mode is to collect a randomly
†††‚definied amount of money. The first player that gets
†††it will win.


(0,105,40)¤Ÿ(20,81,194)†GAME OPTIONS

††‰(165,293,134)
††‰(165,303,134)
š††COLOR SELECT

†††‚This option allows you to choose the color of your
†††shuttle between PINKŒ, YELLOWŒ, BLEUŒ and GREENŒ.

††‰(165,335,32)
††‰(165,345,32)
š††GAME SPEED

†††‚The GAME SPEEDŒ option allows you to select the initial
†††speed of the shuttles. The 3 available speeds are :
†††† NORMAL, EXPERT, HEROES.

††‰(264,314,32)
††‰(264,324,32)
š††RULES

†††‚The RULESŒ option allows you to select the number of
†††‚rounds in the tournament modes: DEATH MATCH,
†††‚KILL'EM ALL, COLOR and TIME CA$H. These values range
†††from 1 to 100 rounds.

††‰(0,293,33)‰(132,293,32)
††‰(0,303,33)‰(132,303,32)
š††RADAR & INFORMATION

†††‚You can disable the RADARŒ and the INFORMATIONSŒ to gain
†††some machine-time.

††‰(66,293,32)
††‰(66,303,32)
š††GLENZ TRAIL

†††‚The GLENZ TRAILŒ option make the trails opaque. This
†††‚makes the gameboard easyer to visualise and increases
†††the fluidity.

††‰(231,314,32)
††‰(231,324,32)
š††LIGHTING

†††‚The LIGHTINGŒ option is here to tune the luminosity of
†††your screen.

††‰(0,314,32)
††‰(0,324,32)
š††INERTIA

†††‚The INERTIAŒ switch enables or disables the scrolling
†††inertia.

††‰(99,293,32)
††‰(99,303,32)
š††AUTOPILOT

†††‚If you are mad, you can try to play without AUTOPILOTŒ,
†††rest in peace...


